cements on mathematical prowess, without compromising the performance on non-mathematical tasks. Our work serves as a preliminary exploration into the arithmetic calculation abilities inherent in LLMs, laying a solid foundation to reveal more intricate mathematical tasks.\",\n    \"pages\": 19\n  }\n]","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
